    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/0e5b2057d2b5617e7b19d976393a976f.avif?t=1752058150\" width=616 height=37 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Driving Rogue\u00a0</strong></i>plunges you into a high-speed rogue-like challenge where every race is a fight for survival and mastery. Navigate treacherous city streets, execute precise manoeuvres, and beat  high scores to reach the very top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81a4e73e1708792d9f30dffe785bd655.poster.avif?t=1752058150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81a4e73e1708792d9f30dffe785bd655.webp?t=1752058150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, drift, and upgrade your car to dominate the roads. Master the art of precision driving to finish each level with both style and speed to progress further and unlock potent upgrades, fresh challenges and new vehicles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/60bab0774f78c2c89614207fd190b432.poster.avif?t=1752058150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/60bab0774f78c2c89614207fd190b432.webp?t=1752058150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each race, visit the shop to grab new mods, unlock special abilities, or grab powerful one-time boosts. Every run is procedurally generated - no two races are ever the same. Build your strategy, modify your car, and push for the longest streak you can. How far will your build take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/0b5b18912b84d0f0a5459622692589d4.poster.avif?t=1752058150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/0b5b18912b84d0f0a5459622692589d4.webp?t=1752058150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >London at Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience riding through a neon-clad London at night, with all the iconic vehicles and spots for you to find and... mainly avoid. Accompanied by a diverse soundtrack that complements the game's nocturnal adrenaline-filled action. There's always something new to see and a fresh challenge to attempt, so there's no shortage of roads to master &amp; places to visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/64b6e6a09cb48352819ddce902e14d6b.poster.avif?t=1752058150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/64b6e6a09cb48352819ddce902e14d6b.webp?t=1752058150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Ending Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the perfect run across a neon-fueled world. Beat your high scores, unlock new cars, collect achievements, and refine your strategy with every attempt. With Eurobeat-inspired tracks and a stylish, glowing world, drifting has never felt this smooth or this addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/1381013f9df265c6f8a1c4abc1a5ed01.avif?t=1752058150\" width=616 height=37 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/0e5b2057d2b5617e7b19d976393a976f.avif?t=1752058150\" width=616 height=37 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Driving Rogue\u00a0</strong></i>plunges you into a high-speed rogue-like challenge where every race is a fight for survival and mastery. Navigate treacherous city streets, execute precise manoeuvres, and beat  high scores to reach the very top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81a4e73e1708792d9f30dffe785bd655.poster.avif?t=1752058150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81a4e73e1708792d9f30dffe785bd655.webp?t=1752058150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, drift, and upgrade your car to dominate the roads. Master the art of precision driving to finish each level with both style and speed to progress further and unlock potent upgrades, fresh challenges and new vehicles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/60bab0774f78c2c89614207fd190b432.poster.avif?t=1752058150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/60bab0774f78c2c89614207fd190b432.webp?t=1752058150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each race, visit the shop to grab new mods, unlock special abilities, or grab powerful one-time boosts. Every run is procedurally generated - no two races are ever the same. Build your strategy, modify your car, and push for the longest streak you can. How far will your build take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/0b5b18912b84d0f0a5459622692589d4.poster.avif?t=1752058150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/0b5b18912b84d0f0a5459622692589d4.webp?t=1752058150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >London at Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience riding through a neon-clad London at night, with all the iconic vehicles and spots for you to find and... mainly avoid. Accompanied by a diverse soundtrack that complements the game's nocturnal adrenaline-filled action. There's always something new to see and a fresh challenge to attempt, so there's no shortage of roads to master &amp; places to visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/64b6e6a09cb48352819ddce902e14d6b.poster.avif?t=1752058150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/64b6e6a09cb48352819ddce902e14d6b.webp?t=1752058150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Ending Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the perfect run across a neon-fueled world. Beat your high scores, unlock new cars, collect achievements, and refine your strategy with every attempt. With Eurobeat-inspired tracks and a stylish, glowing world, drifting has never felt this smooth or this addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/1381013f9df265c6f8a1c4abc1a5ed01.avif?t=1752058150\" width=616 height=37 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
